subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Edit a subscription

USAGE:
  subtrack edit <OPTIONS> [<id>]

ARGUMENTS:
  id           Subscription ID (omit for interactive selection)

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                                 Display this help message
  -v, --version                              Display this version
  --name <name>                              Subscription name
  --price <price>                            Monthly payment amount
  --currency <currency>                      Currency
  --cycle <cycle>                            Billing cycle
  --tags <tags>                              Comma-separated tags
  --status <status>                          Status: active, paused, cancelled
  --billingDay <billingDay>                  Billing day of month (1-31)
  --paymentMethod <paymentMethod>            Payment method
  --vendorName <vendorName>                  Vendor name
  --vendorUrl <vendorUrl>                    Vendor URL
  --planTier <planTier>                      Plan tier (e.g. Pro, Family)
  --discountAmount <discountAmount>          Discount amount (non-negative number)
  --discountType <discountType>              Discount type: percentage or fixed
  --contractStart <contractStart>            Contract start date (YYYY-MM-DD)
  --contractEnd <contractEnd>                Contract end date (YYYY-MM-DD)
  --autoRenewal <autoRenewal>                Auto renew: true or false

